Life expand/collapse First-Year Experience Housing & Dining Health & Wellness Student Activities Athletics Support & Community Lakeside Living Careers & Outcomes expand/collapse Student & Alumni Stories Career Preparation & Resources Cost & Aid expand/collapse Tuition & Fees Scholarships & Calculator Financial Aid How to Apply expand/collapse Admissions Process Visit Campus Virtual Visit Transfer International Admissions Deposit Online Undergraduate expand/collapse Substitute Authorization Programs & Majors expand/collapse Academic Areas by Interest All Online Programs (A-Z) The BVU Experience expand/collapse Career Growth & Support Flexibility & Scheduling Online Student Support & Resources Technology & Tools Cost & Aid expand/collapse Scholarships & Financial Aid Tuition & Fees How to Apply expand/collapse Application Process Transfer Students Strategic Partnerships Graduate expand/collapse Programs & Majors expand/collapse Graduate Programs Graduate Learning Experience expand/collapse Flexible Formats Student Support Cost & Aid expand/collapse Tuition & Fees Financial Aid & Funding How to Apply expand/collapse Admissions Process Application Requirements Resources expand/collapse Academic Calendar Academic Catalog Campus Security Financial Aid Human Resources IT & Campus Tools Library Registrar Connect Alumni expand/collapse Alumni Engagement Events Giving & Impact Alumni Resources Athletics Careers & Outcomes Build Your Future at BVU At BVU, career preparation starts before graduation. Through internships, research, hands-on learning, and professional connections, you’ll gain the experience and confidence to take your next step. Request Information Visit academics Overview Undergraduate Online Graduate Where Beavers Work BVU graduates are building careers across healthcare, technology, business, education, research, communications, and more. Where Our Graduates Land 3M AmeriCorps Bonfire Marketing & Web Co. Cargill Charles Schwab Collins Aerospace Columbia Police Department Corteva Agriscience Gold Creek Games Indiana Fever Iowa Judicial Branch Iowa Wild John Deere KPMG KTIV Madison Square Garden Sports Corp. Mayo Clinic Microsoft Minnesota Vikings Moderna NASA Nebraska Public Media New York Magazine Omaha Storm Chasers Principal Sanford Health Tennessee Titans Tyson Foods U.S. Bank United States Olympic Committee University of Iowa Hospitals & Clinics UnityPoint Health Venmo Von Maur VT Industries Wellmark Blue Cross & Blue Shield Wells Fargo WHO 13 Experience That Prepares You Internships Gain real-world experience with businesses, nonprofits, healthcare organizations, schools, professional sports teams, and other employers. Some programs build internships directly into the curriculum. Research Work alongside faculty, pursue research tied to your interests, and build experience for careers or graduate school. BVU students have access to 18 science labs, three research areas, and the BVU Research Farm. Professional Connections Build your network through alumni, conferences, professional organizations, travel, competitions, and other career-focused opportunities. Outcomes 100% Social Work Placement Rate 90%+ Healthcare Graduates Placed into Graduate Programs 18 science Labs 1+ Internship for Accounting & Business Majors Alumni Success Beaver Stories Alumni Story Jamie Wendt - Software Engineer, Charles Schwab Jamie combined coursework, internships, and funded professional experiences to prepare for a career in technology. Alumni Story Dr. Kimberly Perez - Senior Research Scientist, Moderna Kimberly discovered her passion for research at BVU and built the foundation for a career contributing to human health. Alumni Story Max Olsan - Assistant Women’s Basketball Coach, Pittsburg State University Max gained experience through the Minnesota Vikings, NCAA March Madness, and BVTV before continuing to graduate school. Your Career, Your Way BVU graduates pursue careers and advanced education across business, healthcare, technology, education, research, communications, sports, and public service. Explore Programs Apply to BVU 610 West 4th St. Storm Lake, IA 50588 800-383-9600 admissions@bvu.edu Buena Vista Beavers Explore BVU Undergraduate Programs Online Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Visit Campus Athletics Engage Alumni Giving Work for BVU Shop BVU Gear Tools Academic Calendar Academic Catalog Canvas Financial Aid Registrar Library Campus Map Directory Campus Safety Consumer Information Privacy Policy Terms of Use Web Accessibility Cookie Policy California Privacy Notice Cookie Settings © 2026 Buena Vista University We use cookies to run this site and, with your consent, to analyze traffic and support marketing.\n            You can accept all, reject non-essential, or choose your preferences.\n            See our Cookie Policy . Manage Reject non-essential Accept all Cookie Preferences Manage how BVU uses cookies. Necessary cookies are always on.\n            See our Cookie Policy . Strictly necessary Always on Required for the site to function and stay secure. These can't be switched off. Analytics Help us understand how the site is used so we can improve it. Marketing Used to deliver and measure relevant messages on other sites. Reject non-essential Save preferences Accept all"
