ence Campus Life expand/collapse First-Year Experience Housing & Dining Health & Wellness Student Activities Athletics Support & Community Lakeside Living Careers & Outcomes expand/collapse Student & Alumni Stories Career Preparation & Resources Cost & Aid expand/collapse Tuition & Fees Scholarships & Calculator Financial Aid How to Apply expand/collapse Admissions Process Visit Campus Virtual Visit Transfer International Admissions Deposit Online Undergraduate expand/collapse Substitute Authorization Programs & Majors expand/collapse Academic Areas by Interest All Online Programs (A-Z) The BVU Experience expand/collapse Career Growth & Support Flexibility & Scheduling Online Student Support & Resources Technology & Tools Cost & Aid expand/collapse Scholarships & Financial Aid Tuition & Fees How to Apply expand/collapse Application Process Transfer Students Strategic Partnerships Graduate expand/collapse Programs & Majors expand/collapse Graduate Programs Graduate Learning Experience expand/collapse Flexible Formats Student Support Cost & Aid expand/collapse Tuition & Fees Financial Aid & Funding How to Apply expand/collapse Admissions Process Application Requirements Resources expand/collapse Academic Calendar Academic Catalog Campus Security Financial Aid Human Resources IT & Campus Tools Library Registrar Connect Alumni expand/collapse Alumni Engagement Events Giving & Impact Alumni Resources Athletics Career Preparation & Resources Prepare for What’s Next Career preparation starts from the moment you become a Beaver. BVU’s Career & Personal Development team provides personalized guidance, professional tools, and connections to help you explore your goals and prepare for life after college. Whether you're choosing a career path, preparing for an internship or job, or considering graduate school, you don't have to navigate it alone. Explore Programs Visit Request Information academics Overview Undergraduate Online Graduate Personalized Career Support Your Goals. Your Path. Not sure exactly what you want to do yet? That's okay. Career & Personal Development works one-on-one with students to connect interests, strengths, values, and abilities with majors and career opportunities. As your goals take shape, we'll help you build the skills and confidence to pursue them. Build Your Professional Skills Get support and practical tools to help you stand out to employers and prepare for your next opportunity. Résumés & Cover Letters Create professional materials that showcase your education, experience, and strengths. Interview Preparation Practice interviewing, build confidence, and prepare to connect with employers. Job & Internship Search Find opportunities and develop strategies for navigating your internship or job search. Graduate School Planning Explore graduate and professional programs and get guidance as you consider continuing your education. Career Tools & Resources BVU students have access to career resources that make it easier to explore opportunities and prepare for the hiring process. Beaver Tracks Search job and internship opportunities available to BVU students and alumni. Beaver Tracks Hiration Build résumés and cover letters, prepare for interviews, and strengthen your LinkedIn profile with AI-powered career tools. Hiration Big Interview Practice interviewing and build confidence before the real conversation. Big Interview Career Assessments Explore how your interests, strengths, values, and abilities connect to majors and career possibilities. Learn More About Career Assessments Career & Personal Development We're Here for What's Next From exploring your first career ideas to preparing for your first professional opportunity, Career & Personal Development is here to help you move forward with confidence. Career & Personal Development 800.383.2400 career@bvu.edu Contact Career & Personal Development 610 West 4th St. Storm Lake, IA 50588 800-383-9600 admissions@bvu.edu Buena Vista Beavers Explore BVU Undergraduate 