 & Personal Development team works with you to explore opportunities, strengthen your professional skills, and prepare for your next career move. Whether you're entering a new field, growing within your current organization, or preparing for graduate school, we're here to help you move forward with confidence. Career Tools & Resources BVU students have access to career resources that make it easier to explore opportunities and prepare for the hiring process. Beaver Tracks Search job and internship opportunities available to BVU students and alumni. Hiration Build résumés and cover letters, prepare for interviews, and strengthen your LinkedIn profile with AI-powered career tools. Big Interview Practice interviewing and build confidence before the real conversation. Career Assessments Explore how your interests, strengths, values, and abilities connect to majors and career possibilities. Additional Career Support Support for What’s Next Access additional career resources and personalized support to help you build your skills, pursue new opportunities, and move your career forward. Personalized career coaching Résumé and cover letter reviews Interview preparation and mock interviews Internship & job search support LinkedIn profile guidance Graduate school planning Connect with Career & Personal Development Real Support. Real Results. Whether you're preparing for your first professional role, changing careers, or seeking advancement, our Career & Personal Development team is here to help. Phone: 800.383.2400 (or ext. 2400) Email: career@bvu.edu Contact Career & Personal Development Take the Next Step Build Your Future with Confidence Combine a flexible online bachelor's degree with personalized career support designed to help you achieve your goals—both during your program and after graduation. Request Information Apply Now 610 West 4th St. Storm Lake, IA 50588 800-383-9600 admissions@bvu.edu Buena Vista Beavers Explore BVU Undergraduate Programs Online Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Visit Campus Athletics Engage Alumni Giving Work for BVU Shop BVU Gear Tools Academic Calendar Academic Catalog Canvas Financial Aid Registrar Library Campus Map Directory Campus Safety Consumer Information Privacy Policy Terms of Use Web Accessibility Cookie Policy California Privacy Notice Cookie Settings © 2026 Buena Vista University We use cookies to run this site and, with your consent, to analyze traffic and support marketing.\n            You can accept all, reject non-essential, or choose your preferences.\n            See our Cookie Policy . Manage Reject non-essential Accept all Cookie Preferences Manage how BVU uses cookies. Necessary cookies are always on.\n            See our Cookie Policy . Strictly necessary Always on Required for the site to function and stay secure. These can't be switched off. Analytics Help us understand how the site is used so we can improve it. Marketing Used to deliver and measure relevant messages on other sites. Reject non-essential Save preferences Accept all"
